      ],
      "text": "SA node:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the pacemaker, in the S. and posterior Rt atrial wall near the opening of the SVC; it has the highest inherent rate of depolarization."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
